  "citation": "(1985) 2 Sri LR 35",
  "statement": "A party to a suit cannot set up the title of a third party who is not their predecessor in title and who has not been joined in the action.",
  "supporting_quote": "A party to a suit cannot under s. 3 of the Prescription Ordinance set up the title of a third party who is not his predecessor in title and who has not been joined in the action. The judgment in a case must be declaratory of the right of a party to the suit not of a stranger",
  "statute_section": "SRC071-s3",
  "method": "headnote",
